      "content": "it's not just about the paperwork though. it feels like the whole world is just built to grind people like me down. like, if you don't have the right papers or the right amount of money, you basically don't exist. it's like there's no point in even trying to fight it because the machine is too big. it's just designed to win and let people like me rot. everything feels so pointless.",
