      "content": "what does that even mean though? \"stop engaging with the world\"... i'm already doing that. i'm just waiting for them to notice i'm gone. i feel like if i just stopped existing, the world would just keep spinning like nothing happened, and honestly, that sounds more peaceful than this struggle. it feels like the only way to actually have control over anything is to just... end it. is that really just madness? or is it the only logical thing left?",
